WEBVTT

00:53:28.875 --> 00:53:32.059
I just study other people's jobs.
I live vicariously through them.

00:53:32.083 --> 00:53:33.434
EP: That is so interesting.

00:53:33.458 --> 00:53:37.184
Would you say that you're
passionate about your work?

00:53:37.208 --> 00:53:38.476
AG: Yeah, of course.

00:53:38.500 --> 00:53:39.851
EP: You are.
AG: Absolutely.

00:53:39.875 --> 00:53:42.643
EP: And how do you define that?
AG: You can't tell?

00:53:42.667 --> 00:53:45.726
EP: I think you are deeply
engaged with your work.

00:53:45.750 --> 00:53:47.893
You're curious, there's intensity,

00:53:47.917 --> 00:53:49.184
there's insatiability,

00:53:49.208 --> 00:53:52.309
there is a constant look
for what else is out there

00:53:52.333 --> 00:53:53.601
that I don't know yet.

00:53:53.625 --> 00:53:56.018
I see all of that, but that's what I see.

00:53:56.042 --> 00:53:59.101
When you think I'm passionate about work,

00:53:59.125 --> 00:54:00.976
how do you articulate that?